<title>USA: WellPoint files for share offering.</title>
<headline>WellPoint files for share offering.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellPoint Health Network Inc said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the offering of 10 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Of the shares being offered, three million will be sold by the company and the remaining seven million by the California HealthCare Foundation, the company's principal shareholder. WellPoint will not receive proceeds from the California HealthCare Foundation's sales.</p>
</text>
